/* The query applies a fixpoint predicate under its own universal quantifier.
   A solver that closes the query over its free variables must bind only the
   term variable x, never the predicate I.  Valid: from any x, counting up
   reaches a non-negative value. */
forall (x: int). I x
s.t.
I (x: int): bool =mu x >= 0 \/ I (x + 1);
